    "corrections": [
      "0436: curled ears, wings, paddle feet and combined forms follow labels; both labels removed before returning to normal; water label no longer duplicated in a hand; hands visibly support the lap-held animal; sunlit belly is horizontal on cloth with untouched food nearby; choice materials remain separate; crate hand and notebook-touching paw meet their objects; final reader sits beside crate.",
      "0437: all embroidered trees remain inside textile; cover crow not clipped; copper brooch distinct from removable silver swallow; back shown separately and folded edge on rack conveys two faces; crow works from a stool with tool at fabric; blue thread removed before silver extension; old swallow replaced by eight needle holes; new path continuous to deer feet and horizontal resting end; girl needle reaches thread and face no longer obscures deer; final crow draws in notebook with two cups."
    ],
    "limitations": "Original simplified geometric artwork. Two complete contact sheets and twelve distinct key pages actually inspected; does not claim all 32 pages separately at original resolution or full audio listening."
